  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestine Riwaya Museum in Bethlehem (finalisation of Phase III: Comp</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to establish a model Palestinian interactive and multimedia museum in Bethlehem, called Riwaya (narrative) Museum. It will be a venue for safeguarding and promoting Palestinian cultural diversity and fostering intercultural dialogue as it will serve as a tourist destination. This particular phase aims at completing the renovation of the museum space started in Phase III of the project.

Note: For detailed information about the scope and concerning the current project, please refer to the &quot;Application for grants from the 
Norwegian Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MFA)&quot; in the attachments section.</narrative>
  </description>
